      "id": "1731000000001", "messageType": "message", "replyToId": null, "deletedDateTime": null,
      "createdDateTime": "today-12d 06:40", "subject": "B1-K-2001 high vibration after restart",
      "from": {"user": {"id": "u-01", "displayName": "Marta Quinn"}},
      "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>Sales gas compressor B1-K-2001 came back up at 06:10 and the 2nd stage is reading 6.8 mm/s on the cooler end. It was 2.4 before the trip. Call me on +1 307 555 0142 if you want me to stay out there.</p>"},
      "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:kr-ops@thread.tacv2/1731000000001",
      "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "team-krgp", "channelId": "19:kr-ops@thread.tacv2"},
      "mentions": [],
      "replies": [
        {"id": "1731000000002", "messageType": "message", "replyToId": "1731000000001", "createdDateTime": "today-12d 07:05",
         "from": {"user": {"id": "u-02", "displayName": "Owen Achebe"}},
         "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>Marta, can you check coupling alignment and the lube oil pressure? Send readings to owen.achebe@kestrel.example</p>"},
         "mentions": [{"id": 0, "mentionText": "Marta", "mentioned": {"user": {"id": "u-01", "displayName": "Marta Quinn"}}}]},
        {"id": "1731000000003", "messageType": "message", "replyToId": "1731000000001", "createdDateTime": "today-12d 08:20",
         "from": {"user": {"id": "u-01", "displayName": "Marta Quinn"}},
         "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>Alignment within spec, lube oil 3.1 barg. Vibration is not fixed, still 6.5 mm/s. The cooler fan feels rough.</p>"}},
        {"id": "1731000000004", "messageType": "message", "replyToId": "1731000000001", "createdDateTime": "today-12d 10:45",
         "from": {"user": {"id": "u-01", "displayName": "Marta Quinn"}},
         "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>Found a loose mounting bolt on the 2nd stage cooler fan. Torqued all four, vibration back to 2.2 mm/s. That did it.</p>"}}
      ]
    },
    {
